.SS "Commands:"
.TP
gui [ARGS]
Start GUI, equivalent to running 'vargamesh\-qt [ARGS]' or 'vargamesh\-gui [ARGS]'.
.TP
node [ARGS]
Start node, equivalent to running 'vargameshd [ARGS]' or 'vargamesh\-node [ARGS]'.
.TP
